WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.025 --> 00:00:18.727
Freeze pulled the trigger of the Big Freeze Blaster.

2
00:00:20.347 --> 00:00:21.028
Nothing happened.

3
00:00:21.048 --> 00:00:23.669
"Drat!" said Freddie.

4
00:00:23.689 --> 00:00:28.991
"I used up all the freeze power dealing with that pesky Rocket Girl.

5
00:00:30.211 --> 00:00:34.126
But never mind her—I need to get more ice cream.

6
00:00:35.087 --> 00:00:37.629
I have a lot of banks to rob today."

7
00:00:42.273 --> 00:00:45.336
Roxy finally stopped sliding when she reached the bottom of the hill.

8
00:00:45.356 --> 00:00:49.840
"Whew!" she said, standing up.

9
00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:52.682
Roxy flew back to the top of the hill.

10
00:00:54.123 --> 00:00:54.904
Freddie was gone.

11
00:00:54.924 --> 00:00:59.428
"Freddie must have gone to get more ice cream," thought Roxy.

12
00:01:00.616 --> 00:01:02.297
"He already robbed Dairy Dream.

13
00:01:03.238 --> 00:01:06.880
What other place in Metro City has a lot of ice cream?"

14
00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:08.821
Roxy thought for a moment and then gulped.

15
00:01:08.841 --> 00:01:10.922
"Oh no!

16
00:01:11.863 --> 00:01:14.644
The Metro City Elementary School cafeteria!"

17
00:01:19.848 --> 00:01:24.410
It's hotter in the cafeteria than in our classroom," said Mara.

18
00:01:25.291 --> 00:01:27.152
All the students had just sat down to eat.

19
00:01:28.064 --> 00:01:30.366
Today's lunch was hot meatball sandwiches.

20
00:01:31.707 --> 00:01:36.670
"Eww. Hot food is the last thing I want right now," said Jack.

21
00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:40.213
Suddenly the doors to the cafeteria flew open.

22
00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:43.235
"Rocket Girl!"

23
00:01:43.635 --> 00:01:44.395
shouted a boy.

24
00:01:44.415 --> 00:01:47.718
"Listen up, everyone!"

25
00:01:48.098 --> 00:01:50.460
said Roxy, landing next to the ice cream freezer.

26
00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:53.001
"We don't have much time.

27
00:01:53.922 --> 00:01:56.584
I need you to start eating lots and lots of ice cream!"

28
00:01:57.884 --> 00:02:00.166
The whole cafeteria became silent for a second.

29
00:02:01.226 --> 00:02:02.187
Then a boy spoke up.

30
00:02:02.207 --> 00:02:05.309
"We need to eat lots of ice cream?"

31
00:02:05.609 --> 00:02:06.089
he asked.

32
00:02:06.109 --> 00:02:08.571
"Yes!" said Roxy.

33
00:02:08.591 --> 00:02:09.992
"And quickly!"

34
00:02:10.732 --> 00:02:12.653
She started throwing ice cream to the students.

35
00:02:14.034 --> 00:02:17.557
"Why?" asked another student.

36
00:02:17.577 --> 00:02:19.778
"Who cares why?"

37
00:02:20.238 --> 00:02:20.839
said Terrell.

38
00:02:20.859 --> 00:02:22.760
"Let's just eat!"

39
00:02:25.276 --> 00:02:29.097
Ice cream cones, ice cream sandwiches, and ice cream pops flew through the air.

40
00:02:30.558 --> 00:02:33.278
Soon everyone was eating ice cream, even the teachers.

41
00:02:33.298 --> 00:02:35.899
"Woo-hoo!" shouted Terrell.

42
00:02:35.919 --> 00:02:37.540
"This is great!

43
00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:39.900
I'm finally cooling off."

44
00:02:41.181 --> 00:02:42.521
"I love ice cream!"

45
00:02:42.961 --> 00:02:43.521
said Jack.

46
00:02:45.842 --> 00:02:49.523
When Freddie Freeze burst into the cafeteria, all the ice cream was gone.

47
00:02:49.543 --> 00:02:54.892
"Aargh!" cried Freddie.

48
00:02:54.912 --> 00:02:55.473
Roxy smiled.

49
00:02:55.493 --> 00:02:59.957
"Freddie, you're not going to need that Big Freeze Blaster anymore.

50
00:02:59.977 --> 00:03:02.039
You're going to jail!"

51
00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:07.283
After Roxy took Freddie Freeze to the police station, she headed back to school.

52
00:03:10.085 --> 00:03:11.627
The kids were outside for recess.

53
00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:16.311
Where have you been?"

54
00:03:16.851 --> 00:03:17.412
asked Mara.

55
00:03:17.432 --> 00:03:22.216
"I was helping Principal Penn work on the school website," said Roxy.

56
00:03:23.112 --> 00:03:24.733
She got on a swing and started swinging.

57
00:03:27.394 --> 00:03:29.435
Terrell gave Roxy a suspicious look.

58
00:03:30.416 --> 00:03:33.297
"Rocket Girl came while you were gone," he said.

59
00:03:34.498 --> 00:03:37.259
Roxy just smiled as she flew high in the air.
